{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791889320, "covers_from": "2026-10-13T11:02:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-13T11:03:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791889380, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-13T11:02:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 63301, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "這幾年一直看到台北很多新大樓一直在建\n但發現卻都是玻璃帷幕\n好希望可以它們是綠建築&有頂樓苗圃的大樓", "display_name": "中正代表 No.63,301", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T11:02:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3078, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "我住在建成圓環周邊，想帶小孩去大稻埕碼頭騎腳踏車，但是在牽車去碼頭的路上，驚險萬分", "display_name": "大同代表 No.3,078", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T11:02:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20058, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "教育", "content": "營養午餐", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.20,058", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T11:02:34+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 33250, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "食安", "content": "海鮮是最不容易保存跟中毒過敏的食材，是哪個笨蛋會想放在孩子的營養午餐內，請撲馬上台後一定要修正這問題", "display_name": "文山代表 Angel", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T11:02:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 7956, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市可否不要再砍樹了，種樹需要幾十年的時間，砍樹幾天就沒了", "display_name": "信義代表 No.7,956", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 3078, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.3,078", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 20058, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.20,058", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": tr